#### Set desktop theme
```
ls /usr/share/themes/
gsettings set org.gnome.desktop.interface gtk-theme Yaru-viridian-dark
```

#### Set icon theme
```
ls /usr/share/icons/
gsettings set org.gnome.desktop.interface icon-theme Yaru-viridian-dark
```

#### Dark-theme
```
gsettings set org.gnome.desktop.interface color-scheme [default|prefer-dark]
``` 
